raw:
{
  "thoughts": "Sian wants an answer by today. I can't afford extra hours, not with that energy bill breathing down my neck. But I can't lose her either. I'll tell her straight — no extra hours for now, but I'll revisit after the Northgrid situation settles. And I need to ring Northgrid first thing to spread that bill. Shop's doing okay but those lost customers hurt. Maybe I should think about ordering a bit more from Brook despite the short deliveries — cheaper unit price. But spoilage... I'll keep the order as is for now.",
  "acts": [
    {"op": "converse", "with": "Sian Shah", "opening": "Morning, Sian. About your message — I've been chewing it over. Truth is, with that energy bill landing Saturday, I can't stretch to extra hours right now. But I don't want you thinking I'm brushing you off. Once I've got Northgrid sorted, we'll talk again. That fair?"},
    {"op": "message", "to": "Northgrid", "text": "Good morning, this is Malcolm Nowak, account at Quarry Road. I've got a back-dated bill of $1,080 due Saturday and I can't pay it in one go. Can we set up a payment plan over the next three or four months? I'm good for it, just need some breathing room."}
  ],
  "aims": [
    "Sort Sian's hours and keep her on side",
    "Ring Northgrid, spread the $1,080 bill",
    "Keep shop and household money straight",
    "Watch spoilage and lost customers",
    "Keep an eye on the loans"
  ]
}
